    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d361">

                <pb facs="0515" n="409" xml:id="pg409"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Consul-General Rodgers to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Abstract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-12-17"><hi rendition="#italic">December 17,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rodgers reports that the United States court opened this day, and requests
                    that the department cable date of confirmation of the court officials.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
